@startuml

title Switching a party from the simulated source to the live source

hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left

actor "Party administrator" as u
participant "Routing" as r
participant "bloomberg-sim" as sim
participant "bloomberg-live" as live
participant "Store" as s
participant "Metering" as mt

u -> r : route party to bloomberg-live\neffective now, with a reason
r -> r : check subscription and rights\nwrite audited change
r -> mt : close interval on bloomberg-sim,\nopen interval on bloomberg-live
r -> sim : demand set without this party's ids
r -> live : demand set with this party's ids
live -> s : ticks for the party's items
note right of s
  The series key (item, provider, party)
  does not change. Each observation
  records the source it came from.
end note

@enduml
